{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n『リボンの騎士』の\nゲネプロ見てきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも本当にかっこよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えりか様は\n改めて、歌うますぎ！安定感すごすぎ！\n難しい役だろうに、もう流石だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香の演じてたヘケートめっちゃ好きだった！\nどんな役か全く知らないで行ったから出てきた時にびっくりしたけど(・∀・)\n玲香ってやっぱり何でもできてすごいなーって思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は今まで\nメンバーが出てる舞台は全部観に行ってるけど\n舞台って本当にメンバーがキラキラしてていいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未の出る舞台も楽しみだな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台観に行ったあとは\n蘭世と夢の国へ行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海の方だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ寒かったけど\n蘭世がカイロくれたからほっこり＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前に友達と行ったときはハロウィンだったのに\nもうクリスマス！\n時の流れは早い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世と二人で遊ぶのは初めてだったけど\nいろいろ話せて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部 ＃9』に出てます＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日に引き続き\nまた伊織と同じお仕事"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のブログで\nみり愛や琴子に塩対応されるって書いたけど\n逆に伊織には塩対応してる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/13/1831894/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/156933/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}